{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1427798-ghost-eating-technique-on-battlegroups","id":1427798,"title":"Ghost Eating Technique on battlegroups","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-12-08T19:47:25-08:00","id":1427798,"title":"Ghost Eating Technique on battlegroups","content":"hey so how would you say this charm applies too a battlegroup? Once a battlegroup is at a certain size its assumed you are killing at least a few with your attacks, even if your mostly doing moral damage. my current clunky houserule is too house rule is to keep wound penalties on the magnatude track (but not have them affect any roles), and have the bonus health from size act as &quot;kills&quot; for the purposes of the charm.<br /> <br /> Dose anyone have opinions on how this should be handled better?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6947-cubleds","name":"cubleds","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-08T20:41:03-08:00","id":1427805,"title":"","content":"Yeah. It mostly doesn't work ... as written<br /> <br /> So, okay, the attack shall deal Aggravated damage, meaning that the battle group cannot be healed, or recovered, magically. So there is ... whatever that is worth.<br /> <br /> However, battle groups don't have health tracks, rather they have Magnitude, so do not suffer from wound penalties. Thus no motes are drawn from the attack.<br /> <br /> But, Well... sure. you could <i>house rule</i> treating <i>reduction</i> of Size bonus as the &quot;wound penalty&quot;, or something.<br /> <br /> As to completely routing the group... eh, I'd allow the solar to gain Solar's Essence + Group's Essence, as normal -- treating the group as one character and gathering something from however many spirits were slain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":487,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","user":"Greyman","date":". 12-08-2020, 11:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-10T04:58:31-08:00","id":1427958,"title":"","content":"There's no direct interaction.<br /> But sticking closely to the interpretation of the charm and of bg mechanics, you are dealing damage to the spirits. And a lot of damage at that. Some of it is represented by messing up the ranks and routing them, but a sensible number of spirits is actually being cleaved apart. <br /> So I'd just let you get the kill bonus every time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-10T09:12:59-08:00","id":1427989,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Synapse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1427798-ghost-eating-technique-on-battlegroups?p=1427958#post1427958\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I'd just let you get the kill bonus every time.</div> </div> </div> </div>IMO this is supported by the various charms that do say \u201cOn incapacitating someone or damaging a battle group.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-10T09:14:11-08:00","id":1427990,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1427798-ghost-eating-technique-on-battlegroups?p=1427989#post1427989\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> IMO this is supported by the various charms that do say \u201cOn incapacitating someone or damaging a battle group.\u201d</div> </div> </div> </div>Well one could argue that, because so many charms specifically say that, the fact that this charm omits it is significant. But I would tend to agree based on setting logic...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25834-habitableexoplanet","name":"habitableexoplanet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"296"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-11T23:56:01-08:00","id":1428159,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>habitableexoplanet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1427798-ghost-eating-technique-on-battlegroups?p=1427990#post1427990\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well one could argue that, because so many charms specifically say that, the fact that this charm omits it is significant. But I would tend to agree based on setting logic...</div> </div> </div> </div>Even moreso than previous editions, Exalted 3e was not written in a style designed to pass legalistic scrutiny. I don't think you can take this ommission as a declaration of authorial intent, just a failure to account for a bg of spirits in the anti-spirit Charm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","name":"Blackwell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"977"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-12T07:14:01-08:00","id":1428178,"title":"","content":"For simplicity's sake, I let the players get essence back as if withering damage on battle groups. So it's 1m per hit, plus 5m on reducing size.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1524-pcontop","name":"pcontop","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1524_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}